        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-04T20:17:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "won\u0027t the returned cache be out of date (i.e. not include the XL_ODR_MASK bit)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 136,
