      "message": "Returned cache should have the accelerometer Output Data Rate Information. This function helps to ensure that the accelerometer is disabled for now. Later after finishing whatever we want to do, the cache will ensure that the accelerometer data rate is set to its original value and if it was previously enabled, it will continue to remain so.",
