      "writtenOn": "2018-10-04T20:17:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shouldn\u0027t really need this; it is implied by the build.mk and it won\u0027t link correctly if you don\u0027t have this file (either way it is a compile error)\n\nWhat would be calling this an need the unimplemented version?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 0,
